 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2023 年 3 月 13 日，借贷协议 Euler Finance，损失约 1.97 亿美元，按事发时估值。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 3 月 13 日，借贷协议 Euler Finance，损失约 1.97 亿美元，按事发时估值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 7.92,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 8.674
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "入口，是一个捐赠函数。",
   "spoken": "入口，是一个捐赠函数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-01.mp3",
   "start": 9.74,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 9.838,
   "speechEnd": 12.016
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "它让用户把自己的存款，捐给协议的储备。",
   "spoken": "它让用户把自己的存款，捐给协议的储备。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-02.mp3",
   "start": 13.08,
   "dur": 3.984,
   "speechStart": 13.178,
   "speechEnd": 16.213
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "捐出去，账户的抵押品就少了。",
   "spoken": "捐出去，账户的抵押品就少了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.284,
   "dur": 3.312,
   "speechStart": 17.382,
   "speechEnd": 19.763
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "但这个函数，不检查账户是否仍然健康。",
   "spoken": "但这个函数，不检查账户是否仍然健康。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.816,
   "dur": 4.464,
   "speechStart": 20.914,
   "speechEnd": 24.437
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 25.5,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "speechStart": 25.598,
   "speechEnd": 26.752
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "举个例子。一个账户有 100 美元抵押品，借了 90 美元。",
   "spoken": "举个例子。一个账户有 100 美元抵押品，借了 90 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 27.808,
   "dur": 5.808,
   "speechStart": 27.906,
   "speechEnd": 32.772
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "它捐出 30 美元抵押品，没人检查，也没人偿还。协议的缺口是多少？",
   "spoken": "它捐出 30 美元抵押品，没人检查，也没人偿环。协议的缺口是多少？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.836,
   "dur": 6.912,
   "speechStart": 33.934,
   "speechEnd": 39.907
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "缺口是 20 美元。",
   "spoken": "缺口是 20 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-08.mp3",
   "start": 41.248,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 41.346,
   "speechEnd": 42.81
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "账户只剩 70 美元抵押品，却欠着 90 美元。",
   "spoken": "账户只剩 70 美元抵押品，却欠着 90 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-09.mp3",
   "start": 43.868,
   "dur": 4.584,
   "speechStart": 43.966,
   "speechEnd": 47.62
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "这 20 美元成了坏账，最后由存款人或保险基金承担。",
   "spoken": "这 20 美元成了坏账，最后由存款人或保险基金承担。",
